Package: python3.14
Name: Python 3.14
Version: @VERSION@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Maintainer: k1tty-xz
Depends: ca-certificates
Description: Python 3.14 for iOS (arm64)
 A CPython 3.14 framework build for physical arm64 iOS devices.
 .
 The package preserves CPython's official iOS framework layout for use on a
 jailbroken device. Applications distributed through the App Store should
 embed and sign the framework in Xcode.
